items.flock4h.axos_silver_book.name = Axo's Silver Book
items.flock4h.axos_silver_book.description = Your first spellbook. Right-click to fire a silver-gray bolt for 10 damage. No mana required. Granted once per player in each world/server.
items.flock4h.rimefang.name = Rimefang
items.flock4h.rimefang.description = <color is="#95deef"><b>Winter's Quiet</b></color>\n<i>A shard of deep winter, bound in cold silver.</i>\nSuccessful, unblocked hits freeze enemies for 2 seconds. Repeated hits refresh the freeze.\nCobalt-strength sword. RMB: guard. Uses the native sword combo and signature.
items.flock4h.crystal_seed.name = Arcane Crystal Seed
items.flock4h.crystal_crop.name = Growing Arcane Crystal
items.flock4h.crystal_seed.description = Mine a wild Arcane Crystal for one guaranteed seed. Plant on prepared soil. Grows from small to medium to mature in 15 minutes. Harvest for 2-3 Arcane Crystal Shards; the crystal regrows. Breaking returns its seed.
items.flock4h.evil_core.name = Evil Core
items.flock4h.evil_core.description = <color is="#bd78e8"><b>Heart of the Rune Knight</b></color>\nA guaranteed Rune Knight drop. One core binds every crafted Axo armor or weapon piece.
items.flock4h.arcane_head.name = Arcane Veil Hood
items.flock4h.arcane_chest.name = Arcane Veil Robe
items.flock4h.arcane_legs.name = Arcane Veil Leggings
items.flock4h.arcane_robe.description = <color is="#8dded1"><b>The Quiet Path</b></color>\nFull set: +30% movement speed, +25% maximum health, +25% maximum mana, 20% damage absorption, +5 mana per second, +25% maximum stamina and +50% crafting speed. Enemies detect you within 5 blocks. Permanently unlocks 9 bonus backpack slots the first time the full set is worn. Open Backpack from Inventory. Light cloth, minimal armor.
npcRoles.Whisperion.name = Whisperion
items.flock4h.whisperion_saddle.name = Whisperion Saddle
items.flock4h.whisperion_saddle.description = <color is="#afc9db"><b>A Seat Among the Stars</b></color>\nRMB on your tamed Whisperion to fit the saddle. Tame him with one Azure Kelp using RMB. Interact to ride; Space rises, Crouch descends, Interact dismounts. Empty hand + Crouch + Interact retrieves the saddle.
interactionHints.axoWhisperion = Whisperion: Azure Kelp to tame / saddle to ride
npcRoles.Villa_Soul.name = Villa Soul
items.flock4h.villa_soul.name = Villa Soul
items.flock4h.villa_soul.description = An immortal courier. Collects dropped stacks within 50 blocks of its station and delivers them to the nearest chest with space. If chests fill, carried items stay safe.\nRMB to summon. Interact for status. LMB with an empty hand returns your soul as a dropped item with cargo, progress and upgrades. Only the player who summoned it can collect it. Empty hand + Crouch + Interact also recalls it.
npcRoles.Fossor_Soul.name = Fossor Soul
items.flock4h.fossor_soul.name = Fossor Soul
items.flock4h.fossor_soul.description = An immortal miner. Conjures a private block and harvests one resource every two minutes. RMB with an Arcane Crystal or shard: +0.1 percentage points per premium ore, up to 200 feeds. Crouch + RMB feeds the held stack up to the cap.\nRMB to summon. Interact for status. LMB with an empty hand returns your soul as a dropped item with cargo, progress and upgrades. Only the player who summoned it can collect it. Empty hand + Crouch + Interact also recalls it.
npcRoles.Cruor_Soul.name = Cruor Soul
items.flock4h.cruor_soul.name = Cruor Soul
items.flock4h.cruor_soul.description = An immortal guardian. Stays behind you at a distance and retaliates against targets involved in your fights with a 10-damage bolt every 1.5 seconds. Crouch out of combat to make it wait while you approach.\nRMB to summon. Interact for status. LMB with an empty hand returns your soul as a dropped item with cargo, progress and upgrades. Only the player who summoned it can collect it. Empty hand + Crouch + Interact also recalls it.
interactionHints.axoSoul = Soul: Interact for status / Summoner: empty-hand LMB to collect
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Ore_Agretis.name=Agretis Ore
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Ore_Agretis.description=A foundational metal found with Iron rarity throughout the world. Smelt ore in a Furnace; use bars in Axo equipment recipes.
