npcRoles.Dreadmaw.name = Dreadmaw
npcRoles.Vesperwraith.name = Chiro
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Droplet.name = Blood Droplet
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Droplet.description = A sealed blood specimen. Extract from a living creature with the Bloody Book. Its species is saved in this item.
items.flock4h.AxoTales_DNA_Sample.name = DNA Sample
items.flock4h.AxoTales_DNA_Sample.description = A preserved bloodline. Convert a Blood Droplet with one Essence of Life in the Vitae Extractor. A properly bound sample names its source species.
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Vitae_Extractor.name = Vitae Extractor
interactionHints.axoVitae = Extract DNA: blood + Essence of Life
items.flock4h.Book_Bloody_Texture.name = Bloody Book
items.flock4h.Book_Bloody_Texture.description = RMB: begin an eight-second extraction. Keep aiming at a living creature within eight blocks. Taking damage, losing sight or changing items interrupts it. Each individual can give blood only once. No mana cost. Carrying this book drains 8 HP every 5 seconds.
items.flock4h.Book_Life_Texture.name = Book of Life
items.flock4h.Book_Life_Texture.description = RMB: consume every DNA sample in carried inventory to awaken loyal companions. Uses ALL currently available mana. Needs some mana and safe space for every sample. Companions fight for you and survive saves/restarts.
npcRoles.AxoTales_Bloodbound.name = Bloodbound Companion
items.flock4h.lightning_book.name = Axo's Lightning Book
items.flock4h.lightning_book.description = RMB: call a lightning storm at visible terrain within 40 blocks. Sky aim centers it on you.\n40-block radius. 50 damage per second for 8 seconds. Caster is spared.\n80 mana; 24-second shared storm cooldown; 0.45-second invocation.\nIndependent 10% drop chance from Dreadmaw.
items.flock4h.meteorain_book.name = Axo's Meteorain Book
items.flock4h.meteorain_book.description = RMB: call a meteor rain at visible terrain within 40 blocks. Sky aim centers it on you.\n40-block radius. 50 damage per second for 8 seconds. Caster is spared.\n80 mana; 24-second shared storm cooldown; 0.45-second invocation.\nIndependent 10% drop chance from Dreadmaw.
items.flock4h.starfang_daggers.name = Bloodfang Daggers
items.flock4h.starfang_daggers.description = Recurved silver blades. Grounded LMB attacks add a short dash and light knockback. 30 base damage per hit; 60% faster attack cadence. Hold LMB for 0.8s, then release to throw both blades: 125 base damage each, 250 together. Five-second throw cooldown.
items.flock4h.arcane_wand.name = Axo's Arcane Wand
items.flock4h.arcane_wand.description = <color is="#d8b86a"><b>Voice of the Elder Grove</b></color>\n<i>Old roots remember every spell.</i>\nCast spellbooks in your inventory or carried Spellbook Pouch. RMB: cast. LMB: choose a spell. Crouch+RMB: alternate action.
items.flock4h.spellbook_pouch.name = Axo's Spellbook Pouch
items.flock4h.spellbook_pouch.description = Holds 18 spellbooks and collects newly picked-up books automatically. RMB to open. Carry it to access its spells with an Arcane Wand.
items.flock4h.arcane_wand_silver.description = <color is="#d8b86a"><b>Voice of the Elder Grove</b></color>\n<i>Old roots remember every spell.</i>\nSelected: Silver Book. Uses the original spell cost and cooldown. Keep its book in your inventory or a carried Spellbook Pouch. RMB: cast. LMB: choose a spell. Crouch+RMB: alternate action.
items.flock4h.arcane_wand_heal.description = <color is="#d8b86a"><b>Voice of the Elder Grove</b></color>\n<i>Old roots remember every spell.</i>\nSelected: Heal Book. Uses the original spell cost and cooldown. Keep its book in your inventory or a carried Spellbook Pouch. RMB: cast. LMB: choose a spell. Crouch+RMB: alternate action.
items.flock4h.arcane_wand_teleport.description = <color is="#d8b86a"><b>Voice of the Elder Grove</b></color>\n<i>Old roots remember every spell.</i>\nSelected: Teleport Book. Uses the original spell cost and cooldown. Keep its book in your inventory or a carried Spellbook Pouch. RMB: cast. LMB: choose a spell. Crouch+RMB: alternate action.
