items.flock4h.astral_satchel.name = Axo's Astral Satchel
items.flock4h.astral_satchel.description = RMB: open storage. Search, filter and browse pages. LMB: stack; RMB: one. Toolbar: take/store visible items or Quickstack matching stored types. Workbenches use carried contents. Cannot contain another Astral Satchel. Contents follow its identity on this server.
items.flock4h.arcane_matter.description = Used to craft spellbooks and arcane equipment.
items.flock4h.axos_ancient_sword.description = LMB: longsword combo and charged stab. RMB: Arcane Slash.\n83 base damage; 105 charged damage. Primary attacks are 20% faster than a native longsword.\nCarrying it adds 30 maximum mana.
npcRoles.Tom_Tom.name = Tom Tom
npcRoles.AxoTales_Gray_Cat.name = Gray Cat
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Ancient_Arrow.name = Ancient Arrow
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Ancient_Arrow.description = Carry these arrows in your hotbar, inventory or Backpack. Use a standard shortbow. Hold LMB for at least 0.35 seconds, then release at a living target.\nLocks onto the visible target within 96 blocks and follows it through terrain. 180 impact damage; 60 splash damage within 4 blocks. No block damage.\nNo target: no ammunition is consumed. Native bow signatures keep their normal ammunition behavior.
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Spyglass.name = Axo's Spyglass
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Spyglass.description = Hold RMB to raise the spyglass and focus at 6× magnification. Release to lower it.\nShows name, HP, mana when available and distance for the visible target. Outer lens is darkened.\nDisplay fields can be changed in spyglass-display.json.
items.flock4h.blood_furnace.name = Blood Furnace
items.flock4h.blood_furnace.description = Smelts ores and cooks food at twice normal speed. One blood droplet fuels five minutes of active processing. Four input and four output slots.
items.flock4h.arcane_pickaxe.name = Arcane Pickaxe
items.flock4h.arcane_pickaxe.description = LMB mines a 3x3x3 volume for 10 mana. Hold RMB to keep mining. F raises the pickaxe, strikes a small crater and launches you 25 blocks. Space cancels during the animation. Bedrock, containers and protected blocks are preserved.
items.flock4h.ancient_endgame_sword.name = Ancient Sword
items.flock4h.ancient_endgame_sword.description = A Legendary greatsword. 160 base melee damage; 200 on a charged stab. RMB releases a 100-damage slash for 30 mana.\nNeed Mithril for the Ancient Pickaxe? Feed Arcane Crystals to a Fossor Soul.

npcRoles.Cursed_Knight.name = Cursed Knight
npcRoles.Chiro.name = Chiro

items.flock4h.AxoTales_Vitae_Extractor.description = Converts 1 blood sample and 1 Essence of Life into 1 DNA sample in five seconds.\nPlace and Interact to open. LMB transfers a stack; RMB transfers one.

items.flock4h.skill_tree.name = Skill Tree
items.flock4h.skill_tree.description = Interact with the fully grown tree to spend runes and learn permanent skills.
items.flock4h.skill_tree_seed.name = Skill Tree Seed
items.flock4h.skill_tree_seed.description = Plant in open ground. Grows into a Skill Tree in 15 real minutes.
items.flock4h.rune.description = Break to absorb one rune. Spend runes at a fully grown Skill Tree.
