items.flock4h.ancient_armor_helm.name = Ancient Helm
items.flock4h.ancient_armor_helm.description = +40 health, +35 mana, +25 stamina and +30% stamina regeneration. Breathe underwater and swim 50% faster. Restores 10 mana every 4 seconds. Reflects projectiles toward their attacker for 1.3x damage.\n<color is="#bde6ff"><b>Full Ancient set</b></color>: +400 health, +100 stamina and +50% speed.\n+15% attack damage, +40% elemental resistance and +50% defense.\n+50% maximum mana, 10 mana every 2 seconds and +50% stamina regeneration.\n+300% crafting speed. One extra air jump. Permanently unlocks 27 bonus Backpack slots.
items.flock4h.ancient_armor_chestplate.name = Ancient Chestplate
items.flock4h.ancient_armor_chestplate.description = +150 health, +20% maximum health, +25 stamina, +50% defense, +30% stamina regeneration and +30% melee/projectile damage. Enemies detect you only within 4 blocks. Crouch + jump toggles 10 seconds of flight; land to refill.\n<color is="#bde6ff"><b>Full Ancient set</b></color>: +400 health, +100 stamina and +50% speed.\n+15% attack damage, +40% elemental resistance and +50% defense.\n+50% maximum mana, 10 mana every 2 seconds and +50% stamina regeneration.\n+300% crafting speed. One extra air jump. Permanently unlocks 27 bonus Backpack slots.
items.flock4h.ancient_armor_gauntlets.name = Ancient Gauntlets
items.flock4h.ancient_armor_gauntlets.description = +40 health, +35 mana, +25 stamina, +20% defense and +30% stamina regeneration. LMB with an empty hand casts an exploding blue fireball for 71-110 base damage.\n<color is="#bde6ff"><b>Full Ancient set</b></color>: +400 health, +100 stamina and +50% speed.\n+15% attack damage, +40% elemental resistance and +50% defense.\n+50% maximum mana, 10 mana every 2 seconds and +50% stamina regeneration.\n+300% crafting speed. One extra air jump. Permanently unlocks 27 bonus Backpack slots.
items.flock4h.ancient_armor_boots.name = Ancient Boots
items.flock4h.ancient_armor_boots.description = +40 health, +35 mana, +25 stamina and +20% defense. Move 30% faster, jump 3 blocks higher, gain one extra air jump and take no fall damage.\n<color is="#bde6ff"><b>Full Ancient set</b></color>: +400 health, +100 stamina and +50% speed.\n+15% attack damage, +40% elemental resistance and +50% defense.\n+50% maximum mana, 10 mana every 2 seconds and +50% stamina regeneration.\n+300% crafting speed. One extra air jump. Permanently unlocks 27 bonus Backpack slots.
items.flock4h.everflame.name = Everflame Shortbow
items.flock4h.everflame.description = A shortbow with endless arrows. Hits ignite the target for 4 seconds. Native draw and release controls.
items.flock4h.mirethorn.name = Mirethorn Shortbow
items.flock4h.mirethorn.description = Poisons targets and slows movement by 25% for 6 seconds. Its effects apply to every arrow type.
items.flock4h.spoiled_heart.name = Spoiled Heart
items.flock4h.spoiled_heart.description = A Legendary heart guaranteed from Dreadmaw. Three craft an Arcane Oraculum.
items.flock4h.oraculum.name = Arcane Oraculum
items.flock4h.oraculum.description = Single-use. Place, then RMB to arm a 5-second blast. Spends all current mana. 4000 base damage to living entities within 250 blocks, including you; preserves terrain.
interactionHints.axoOraculum = Arm Oraculum (all mana, 5 seconds)
items.flock4h.Book_Leech_Texture.name = Leech Book
items.flock4h.Book_Leech_Texture.description = Hold RMB to drain a living target within 16 blocks. Deals 30 damage and restores 20 health each second for 10 mana. Release, blocked sight or leaving range ends the drain.
items.flock4h.arcane_wand_leech.description = Selected: Leech Book. Hold RMB to drain a living target within 16 blocks: 30 damage, 20 health restored and 10 mana spent each second. Carry its book or a Spellbook Pouch containing it. LMB: choose a spell.
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Rex.name = Rex Blood Sample
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Rex.description = Extract from a living Rex with the Bloody Book. One of four distinct samples needed to craft the Leech Book. Also usable in the Vitae Extractor.
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Dreadmaw.name = Dreadmaw Blood Sample
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Dreadmaw.description = Extract from a living Dreadmaw with the Bloody Book. One of four distinct samples needed to craft the Leech Book. Also usable in the Vitae Extractor.
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Yeti.name = Yeti Blood Sample
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Yeti.description = Extract from a living Yeti with the Bloody Book. One of four distinct samples needed to craft the Leech Book. Also usable in the Vitae Extractor.
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Emberwulf.name = Emberwulf Blood Sample
items.flock4h.AxoTales_Blood_Emberwulf.description = Extract from a living Emberwulf with the Bloody Book. One of four distinct samples needed to craft the Leech Book. Also usable in the Vitae Extractor.
items.flock4h.workbench.name = Axo's Workbench
items.flock4h.workbench.description = Craft Axo Tales items, equipment, spellbooks, blood machines and potions.
items.flock4h.poisonous_vine.name = Poisonous Vine
items.flock4h.poisonous_vine_seed.name = Poisonous Vine Seed
items.flock4h.poisonous_vine_seed.description = Plant a dark-purple screen that grows up and sideways. Walk through its leaves at the cost of 10 seconds of poison.
