items.flock4h.frozen_chest.name = Frozen Chest
items.flock4h.frozen_chest.description = Blood Droplets and DNA only. Place two beside each other for eight rows; one chest has four rows.
items.flock4h.ancient_pickaxe.name = Ancient Pickaxe
items.flock4h.ancient_pickaxe.description = Unbreakable. Ores drop three times their normal loot. Strong knockback, with a 1.1-2 block kickback on use. Hold RMB for 3x3 mining. F: raise, smash and leap 25 blocks. Space cancels during the animation.
